<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Feb 11.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Feb 11.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on February 11:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		 Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>General	    ---/100 (LDD)   ---/350  Maria Galaxy     08/02</p>
<p>General	    ---/ 35 (LDD)   ---/184  Tiger Creek	10/02</p>
<p>Rock Phosphate   660/--- (ULD) 8,600/---  Hulin		10/02</p>
<p>HB Iron	  2,130/--- (ULD)   331/---  Kumar		07/02</p>
<p>Coal	     9,532/--- (ULD)17,960/---  Surya Kiruba     08/02</p>
<p>Logs		 706/--- (ULD)   853/---  Kee Ann	    09/02</p>
<p>Coal	    19,552/--- (ULD)   500/---  Nand Neethi	09/02</p>
<p>Wheat	    6,600/--- (ULD)33,400/---  Asian Excelsior  06/02</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
